       "data": "MatrixForm[{{k1 + k1^2*v3 + k1*v3^2 + k1^2*v3^2, k2 + k2^2*v4 + k2*v4^2 + k2^2*v4^2, k3 + k3^2*v1 + k3*v1^2 + k3^2*v1^2, k4 + k4^2*v2 + k4*v2^2 + k4^2*v2^2}, {k5 + k5^2*v7 + k5*v7^2 + k5^2*v7^2, k6 + k6^2*v8 + k6*v8^2 + k6^2*v8^2, k7 + k7^2*v5 + k7*v5^2 + k7^2*v5^2, k8 + k8^2*v6 + k8*v6^2 + k8^2*v6^2}, {v1 + k3^2*v1 + k3*v1^2 + k3^2*v1^2, v2 + k4^2*v2 + k4*v2^2 + k4^2*v2^2, v3 + k1^2*v3 + k1*v3^2 + k1^2*v3^2, v4 + k2^2*v4 + k2*v4^2 + k2^2*v4^2}, {v5 + k7^2*v5 + k7*v5^2 + k7^2*v5^2, v6 + k8^2*v6 + k8*v6^2 + k8^2*v6^2, v7 + k5^2*v7 + k5*v7^2 + k5^2*v7^2, v8 + k6^2*v8 + k6*v8^2 + k6^2*v8^2}}]",
